data/common_passwords.txt — breached-password list
===================================================

Source
  Pwdb_top-1000000.txt from SecLists, pinned to commit
  758fecf4925900dd1bd0a3cba39551d6b4f2da8c:
  https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists/blob/758fecf4925900dd1bd0a3cba39551d6b4f2da8c/Passwords/Common-Credentials/Pwdb_top-1000000.txt

  The list is derived from real passwords exposed in public breaches. It is
  the top million of the Pwdb-Public data set (ignis-sec/Pwdb-Public), ranked
  by how often each password appeared.

